---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Team"
  description="The people and collaborators building Entif AI research, protocols, and open engineering systems."
>
  <section class="section shell topic-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">People</p>
    <h1>Team</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Entif AI is being built through a research-and-engineering collaboration
        model centered on inspectable work: papers, specifications, issues,
        experiments, code, and reviewable decisions.
      </p>
      <p>
        Named profiles and contributor roles will be added here as the public
        team roster is formalized. Until then, the repository history remains
        the most precise record of active technical contribution.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
